    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856770/extras/fc8f6345c5a905fd85e6ebf1fc33fdaf.poster.avif?t=1728841193\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856770/extras/fc8f6345c5a905fd85e6ebf1fc33fdaf.webm?t=1728841193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856770/extras/fc8f6345c5a905fd85e6ebf1fc33fdaf.mp4?t=1728841193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Simple Things</strong></i> is a tiny town-building game created by two close friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill your villagers with joy as you craft cosy homes for them.  Then sit back, relax and watch them prosper!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place buildings wherever you please</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attract villagers from far and wide</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add props to keep your villagers busy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat, management, or timers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a variety of freeform tools</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new levels and biomes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We really hope you enjoy this tiny experience and can't wait to see all of your wonderful creations!</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856770/extras/fc8f6345c5a905fd85e6ebf1fc33fdaf.poster.avif?t=1728841193\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856770/extras/fc8f6345c5a905fd85e6ebf1fc33fdaf.webm?t=1728841193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856770/extras/fc8f6345c5a905fd85e6ebf1fc33fdaf.mp4?t=1728841193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Simple Things</strong></i> is a tiny town-building game created by two close friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill your villagers with joy as you craft cosy homes for them.  Then sit back, relax and watch them prosper!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place buildings wherever you please</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attract villagers from far and wide</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add props to keep your villagers busy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat, management, or timers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a variety of freeform tools</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new levels and biomes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We really hope you enjoy this tiny experience and can't wait to see all of your wonderful creations!</i></p>",
    "short_description": "Relax and create beautiful homes for your villagers in this simple, stress-free building game.",
